label demo_dissertation:
    scene black_bg
    play ambience audio.disstalk fadein 2.0 # ?
    show intro_quote_1_cg
    pause 2.0
    show intro_quote_2_cg
    pause 2.0
    show intro_quote_3_cg
    pause 2.0
    play sound audio.wine_tap
    stop ambience fadeout 0.5
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_01
    zeus "So, my wonderful daughter, how many PhDs do you have now?" # VA: Proud, playful.
    athena "Ninety-nine, Father." # VA: Slightly embarrassed, but proud.
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_02
    zeus "Ninety-nine PhDs?" # VA: Genuine disbelief.
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_03
    zeus "So that headache you gave me when you were born, it was worth it after all!" # VA: Booming dad-joke, but Zeus knows THAT Athena knows how important to him she really is.
    athena "...I'd think so, yes." # VA: Slightly embrassed. She still isn't used to such high praises. 
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_dionysus_01
    dionysus "So what was the subject of your dissertation this time, Athena?"
    show athena_dissertation_cg with fade
    athena "Etruscan influences on the development of Greek pottery." # VA: Proud, matter-of-fact. Athena is proud of her work, even if the subject matter is a bit on the dry side. 
    play sound audio.dionysus_drunk
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_dionysus_02
    dionysus "And I thought it was the other way around!" # Amazeused. 
    nike "Me too!" # VA: Bright, eager to agree.
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_hephaestus_01
    hephaestus "Shows us how much we know about ancient history, huh?" # VA: Smiling, self-deprecating.
    play sound audio.athena_snort
    show athena_dissertation2_cg with fade
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_04
    zeus "A toast then." # VA: Loud, formal tone. He wants everyone to know how proud he is of his daughter.
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_05
    zeus "To Athena." # VA: Emphasis on her name.
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_06
    zeus "My daughter, in case anyone here on Olympus University has lived underneath, well, how shall we say..." # VA: Long winded set-up for the punchline. 
    play sound audio.zeus_cough
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_07
    zeus "A Persian boulder for the last few years." # VA: Punchline delivery.
    play sound audio.crowd_boo
    ahura "I heard that." # Annoyed clip. 
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_08
    zeus "Yes, boo all you want. But keep in mind we DO have a few Persian boulders here on campus, so they might take offence to it." # VA: Playful control of the crowd. He can't help but get a dig into Ahura.
    play sound audio.crowd_laugh
    ahura "Hmph." # Defiant grunt. 
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_09
    zeus "Anyway, to Athena." # VA: Warm, proud reset. 
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_10
    zeus "To the most brilliant student in the history of Olympus University." # VA: Proud over the top praise.
    voice voice_demo_dissertation_zeus_11
    zeus "And the best daughter a father could ever ask for." # VA: Sickly sweet pride, the sort of guff found on a late 90's family sitcom.
    play sound audio.crowd_cheer
    pause 1.0
    show athena_dissertation3_cg with fade
    stop audio fadeout 0.5
    play audio audio.dissertation_question loop
    athena "Between all the badgering of questions, I realised I should've been happy." # VA: Beginning of Athena's internal monologue. 
    athena "I'd completed my 99th dissertation, and graduation from Olympus University was only weeks away." # VA: Reflective, matter-of-fact tone.
    athena "I should be happy." # VA: Slightly sad emphasis on the word "should."
    scene black_bg with fade
    pause 1.5
    stop audio
    athena "But I wasn't." # VA: Slight sadness. Disapointment even after all her achievements.
    athena "Something was missing." # VA: Athena feels it in her bones, but she can't quite put her finger on it.
    athena "Like there was some lost soul hiding underneath a Persian boulder." # VA: Reflective, searching tone. Athena is trying to name the feeling she's carrying.
    athena "Like there was someone out there who needed my help." # VA: Quiet conviction. The thought lands with a sense of purpose.
    pause 0.5
    athena "But where?" # VA: Slightly more urgent, reflective tone. End of internal monologue.
    pause 1.0
    return